The routing core (crates/commutator-router) is a Rust port of solo-router
(https://github.com/ddiddi/solo-router), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The files config.rs, signals.rs and router.rs were translated from
solo-router's config.py, signals.py and router.py and changed by Armature AI
Labs; each carries a notice saying so. crates/commutator-router/router.yaml is
solo-router's default configuration, unmodified. tests/parity/fixtures.json
contains outputs produced by running solo-router.

solo-router's NOTICE file reads:

  Solo Router
  Copyright 2026 Solo Router contributors

  This project adapts the signal -> decision -> algorithm routing architecture of
  vLLM Semantic Router (https://github.com/vllm-project/semantic-router),
  licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. No source files were copied;
  the implementation here is independent and specialized for robotics.
